# FIX 28 — FROZEN DATA CENTER TYPE CLASSIFICATION CORPUS
#
# Every DISTINCT classifier input behind the 1,218 point-scope Data-center CANDIDATE
# records in production `public.development_reports.sites` on 2026-09-15, captured BEFORE
# any Fix 28 implementation. 426 rows. The fields are exactly what HS.trackerSiteItem reads
# (use_type, layer, label, registry_id); site_type/category are carried so the row can be
# rebuilt verbatim.
#
# `expect` is NOT generated from lib/map.js. It is the verdict of the PRODUCTION SQL
# projection public.map_site_is_datacenter_type(), read back out of the database. The test
# that consumes this file runs the SHIPPED lib/map.js classifier and asserts the two agree,
# so neither side can drift without a red test — and the fixture is not circular.
#
